          "content": "Chapter 3 Mindful Eating: A Pathto a Healthy Body"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.268,
            0.545,
            0.326
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "66 कोऽरुक्? कोऽरुक्? कोऽरुक्? हितभुक् मितभुक् ऋतुभुक्"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.606,
            0.322,
            0.695,
            0.348
          ],
          "content": "**(सभाु षित)**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.354,
            0.701,
            0.415
          ],
          "content": "Who is healthy? Who is healthy? Who is healthy? One who eats food that is wholesome, in moderate quantities, and appropriate for the season, time, and place."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
